      "source": "HYBE X GEFFEN / KATSEYE Official",
      "title": "KATSEYE Unveil New EP 'WILD' With 'Unloveu' & 'That Way'!",
      "excerpt": "Six tracks including Bel Air and Hootie Frutti. Concept films and tour dates inside.",
      "quote": "EYEKONS — our wildest era is here!",
      "image": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/fE8qh1-UvVA/maxresdefault.jpg",
      "body": [
        "KATSEYE have officially released their new EP 'WILD', led by tracks 'Unloveu', 'Bel Air', 'That Way' and 'Hootie Frutti' across official channels this week.",
        "HYBE X GEFFEN RECORDS confirms the project was recorded together by all six members, with music videos filmed across Los Angeles and Seoul.",
        "The EP arrives ahead of the Beautiful Chaos world tour extension, where EYEKONS will hear the new songs live for the first time.",
        "Pre-save links and exclusive merch drops are open now on all major streaming platforms."
      ]
